{"id":"067a36526639087d","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-substitution-function.md","title":"Substitution Function","display":"df-substitution-function — Substitution Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-substitution-function","aliases":["92-df-substitution-function"],"display":"df-substitution-function — Substitution Function","depends_on":["[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-numeral]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-substitution]]","[[92-df-encoding-completeness]]","[[92-df-arithmetization-formula]]"],"source":"第 II 章 pp. 24–25（PDF 41–42）","source_status":"本地算术化补充"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-substitution-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-substitution-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-substitution-function — Substitution Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bb4321f7cd8a5eb1\" href=\"?note=bb4321f7cd8a5eb1\" title=\"92-df-encoding-completeness\">92-df-encoding-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"af5c6b1bb1806001\" href=\"?note=af5c6b1bb1806001\" title=\"92-df-arithmetization-formula\">92-df-arithmetization-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 II 章 pp. 24–25（PDF 41–42）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地算术化补充"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-substitution-function-—-Substitution-Function-$\\mathrm{Sub}$\">df-substitution-function — Substitution Function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m \\in \\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)\">\\(m \\in \\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)\\)</span> (Gödel code of a formula, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n \\in \\mathbb{N}\">\\(n \\in \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (number to substitute)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner \\cdot \\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner \\cdot \\urcorner\\)</span> (Gödel numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dec}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Dec}_G\\)</span> (inverse decoder on legal expression codes, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"bb4321f7cd8a5eb1\" href=\"?note=bb4321f7cd8a5eb1\" title=\"92-df-encoding-completeness\">92-df-encoding-completeness</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\">\\(v_0\\)</span> (the distinguished variable used for unary substitution)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}\\)</span> (definition target substitution function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G\\)</span> (syntactic substitution operation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> (numeral for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}function} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sub}:\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Sub}(m,n)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\mathrm{Dec}_G(m),\\bar n,v_0)\\urcorner\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}function} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sub}:\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Sub}(m,n)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\mathrm{Dec}_G(m),\\bar n,v_0)\\urcorner\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}(m, n)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}(m, n)\\)</span> : 代入函数</li>\n<li>将<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar{n}\">\\(\\bar{n}\\)</span>代入Gödel数为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>的公式中的自由变量</li>\n<li>本定义中的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}\\)</span>只在合法公式码上取值；在本书固定的有效编码与文法下，公式码可判定且该函数有全递归（事实上可取原始递归）延拓。单凭Gödel编号是单射不能推出这一有效性结论</li>\n<li>对合法公式码<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>，对角化函数满足<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(n)=\\mathrm{Sub}(n,n)\">\\(d(n)=\\mathrm{Sub}(n,n)\\)</span></li>\n<li>这是实现自引用的核心操作</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>这是本地一般替换码函数，原书在此阶段通过 r(e,n) 的 wrapper 绕开一般替换算术化。Sub 仅在合法公式码上有定义，非法码全扩张及 PR 性质分别保证；不能把本地算法说成原书此处实际采用的构造。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 II 章 pp. 24–25（PDF 41–42）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-substitution-function-—-Substitution-Function-$\\mathrm{Sub}$","text":"df-substitution-function — Substitution Function $\\mathrm{Sub}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"b78092e29a02d697","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"725c1f1651ce9a00","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-encoding-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"bb4321f7cd8a5eb1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-encoding-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetization-formula","status":"resolved","id":"af5c6b1bb1806001","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetization-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$m \\in \\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)$ (Gödel code of a